 130:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *  Typically, this is implemented so that HID devices (mice, keyboards, etc.) can wake up the
